            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="                                                                   Children (6&#x2013;13 years)&#xa;                                                      Recommended Sleep: 9&#x2013;11 hours                              &#xa;                                                  Ideal Sleep Time: 9:00 PM &#x2013; 6:30 AM    &#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Tips &amp; Suggestions:&#xa;&#xa;1.Aim for 9-11 hours of sleep every night.&#xa;&#xa;2.Maintain a regular sleep schedule with consistent bedtimes and wake times.&#xa;&#xa;3.Avoid screen time at least 1 hour before bedtime.&#xa;&#xa;4.Create a calming bedtime routine (reading, warm bath).&#xa;&#xa;5.Keep the sleeping environment quiet, dark, and comfortable.&#xa;&#xa;6.Limit caffeine and sugary drinks, especially in the afternoon and evening.&#xa;&#xa;7.Encourage physical activity during the day.&#xa;&#xa;8.Avoid heavy meals close to bedtime."/>
